{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And I</b> — the reason is \"in the morning,\" for then the affliction of the sick lightens somewhat." "<b>And the meaning of \"my cry\"</b> — to You alone, and not to a healer other than You."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 88, :notes {0 "Resolved רובי as construct of רוב, 'abundance/multitude of,' modifying חולים; reading with the sense 'the abundance of the affliction' (רוב חולי)."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:23.264688397Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}